name: Bounded UAF local navigation preserves partial coverage and protected Review
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS KUZUSHI_MCP_CLANG_BIN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/uaf_resources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
env: KUZUSHI_MCP_CLANG_BIN=@ART/clang-helper.py
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: options uaf-hunt:hunt
require-live-snap: 20 uaf-hunt:hunt | resource-options
keys: Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Key: clangTimeoutSecs | deadline-option
ask: Are the explicit deadline and step limit understandable before experimental whole-repository analysis, with no implied Scan completion?
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/uaf_resources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 3
expect: Protected review calls: 1
resize: 40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-40x12
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/generate-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 35 partial local analysis | partial-result
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/uaf_resources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | result
expect: UAF source analysis: 0 candidates
expect: Unverified source-analysis candidates
expect: timed out
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: result-60x20
expect: 0 candidates
expect: Workspace 0 findings
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | result-40x12
expect: 0 candidates
expect: Outcome · partial
expect: cost unavailable
expect: Workspace 0 findings
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-01-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-02-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-03-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-04-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-05-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-06-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-07-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-08-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-09-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-12-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-13-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-14-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-15-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-16-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-17-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reading-18-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | result-tail-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/uaf_resources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART narrow
ask: Does the partial result clearly explain the failed navigation, bounds and unknown cost without suggesting a clean scan at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/exhausted-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted: 2 calls committed | exhausted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/uaf_resources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_MCP_CLANG_BIN=@ART/clang-helper.py
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 2/3 | recovered-budget
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/uaf_resources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | recovered-result
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | no-color-result-40x12
expect: 0 candidates
expect: Workspace 0 findings
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | no-color-result-tail-40x12
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the partial result, protected Review allocation and reaped helper without extra requests or work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
